No permission is granted to copy, modify, distribute, publish, sublicense,
sell, or run this software, in whole or in part, for any purpose. You may
read it, and you may link to it. That is all, unless the copyright holder
agrees otherwise in writing.

Being able to read something is not permission to use it. A web app is sent
to the browser of everybody who opens it — that is how the web works, and it
has never been a grant of rights over what was sent.

To ask for permission, open an issue on the repository.


